## XP System (MVP)
XP is earned from consistent actions:
- Workout quest → XP
- Food goal (healthy choice) → XP (daily cap)
- Water goal → XP (daily cap)
- Weigh-in goal → XP (daily cap)
- Exercise verification (Page 3.5 optional) → XP (daily cap)
- Weekly check-in bonus → XP
Anti-spam: each category has a daily cap.
---
## Consistency Rules (Inactivity + Checkpoints)
### Weekly Check-In (Save Progress)
- Must check in at least once every 7 days
- If inactive for 7 days:
- revert to a checkpoint (game-state penalty, not deleting health data)
### Shop Lock (Inactivity Penalty)
- Inactive for 7 days → Shop locked
- Unlock Shop: complete at least 1 quest/day for 3 consecutive days
### Goal Re-Evaluation (No Progress Loss)
- Every 3–4 weeks
- Updates personalization and quest difficulty
- Does not reset:
- XP/Level
- Achievements
- Purchases/cosmetics
- Weight history
